### Soft delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/user?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "69d0dac112c27a9a11bffbb4"
}

### Restaurar un usuario que fue soft deleteado
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/user/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "69d0dac112c27a9a11bffbb4"
}

### Crear compañía (ruta protegida)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mi Empresa",
    "cif": "E12345678",
    "address": {
        "street": "Calle Falsa",
        "number": 123,
        "postal": 28001,
        "city": "Madrid",
        "province": "Madrid"
    }
}

### Actualizar compañía (ruta protegida)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/company/69d0dbd364ffef7c376a4d4c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mi Empresa Actualizada",
    "cif": "E12345678",
    "address": {
        "street": "Calle Falsa",
        "number": 123,
        "postal": 28001,
        "city": "Madrid",
        "province": "Madrid"
    }
}

### Subir el logo de la compañía con Multer
### Esto lo que hace es coger el archivo de Content-Disposition y guardarlo en storage
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/company/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="test_logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test_logo.png
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Obtener compañías (ruta protegida)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft delete de la compañía (ruta protegida)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/company/69d0dbd364ffef7c376a4d4c?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hard delete de la compañía (ruta protegida)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/company/69d0dbd364ffef7c376a4d4c?soft=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invitar a un usuario
### Consiste en crear un nuevo usuario con los datos del JSON y meterle en la compañía del usuario que tiene el token
### El que invita debe ser admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email@address.com",
    "name": "Email",
    "lastName": "Address",
    "nif": "12345678A",
    "address": {
        "street": "Calle X",
        "number": 123,
        "postal": 28001,
        "city": "Madrid",
        "province": "Madrid"
    }
}